**ONE USER TASK → ONE CLEAR SCREEN → ONE PRIMARY ACTION.**

Do not create multiple navigation destinations for the same business operation.

Do not use duplicate buttons to compensate for confusing navigation.

Do not force users to understand internal workflow states.

Do not present a green success message before the server confirms success.

Do not sacrifice business correctness while simplifying the interface.

